# 10_three_panel_summary.R — AUTO-DERIVED from 10_three_panel_summary.R, 17 Aug 2026.
# ⛔ DO NOT EDIT BY HAND. PJ, 17 Aug: drop the Chow panels from the Ch2 figures; each series' shape
